# Phase IS1 -- the induction skill, its routes and its pins

## 1. Status

**Draft r1, awaiting plan approval, then this spec's own owner gate.** It is
blocked on D1, D3, D8 and D9 (plan §10), which change file names, file counts
and pinned values. No implementation has started.

