## 8. Tests

Red first: T2..T7 and T9's edits are committed before the skill exists, and
the run is retained as `evidence/IS1/regressions-red.txt`.

| # | File | Case | Expected |
|---|---|---|---|
| T1 | `tests/test_packaged_skills.py` | `test_every_packaged_skill_frontmatter_reads_back` over the new skill | pass |
| T2 | `tests/test_packaged_skills.py` | names, file set and count, link set and count, the four new routing rows, `RECORD_ROUTES`, denials, the orm-core index | red before; pass after |
| T3 | `tests/test_verification_fixes.py` | `EXPECTED_SKILL_FILES` | red before; pass after |
| T4 | `tests/test_install.py`, `tests/test_doctor_uninstall.py` | 17 names; both link maps | red before; pass after |
| T5 | `tests/test_public_agents_skill_table.py` | AGENTS.md row | red with the skill and no row; pass after |
| T6 | `tests/test_marketplace_plugins.py` | count 17 | red before; pass after |
| T7 | `tests/test_public_packaged_invocation_guards.py` | per-skill count and floor; with D9, `gnd export ilp --help` and `gnd import ilp-rules --help` exit 0 | red before; pass after |
| T8 | `tests/test_induce_skill.py` (new) | R-a..R-g each appear once in the packaged tree and only in `gnd-induce/SKILL.md`; the reactions table appears once; the stop sentence names exit 3; the handoff names exit 0; a seeded copy of R-c in a second file fails by name | pass; the seeded case fails as named |
| T9 | `tests/test_ik6_skill_census.py` | pinned to `077f46e`; all its cases, including the four seeded faults | pass with the new skill present |
| T10 | `tests/test_packaged_skills.py` | `test_base_dependency_set_is_frozen`; T8 also asserts no `pip install` or `uv add` line in the skill | pass |
| T11 | docs | `zensical build --strict`; `tools/check_docs.py site` | no issues; exit 0 |
| T12 | installer | `uv run gnd install --symlink --project --force`, then `uv run gnd doctor --project` | exit 0 each |
| T13 | `tests/test_solve_successors.py` | frozen directories unchanged; `test_t25` station numbers | pass |
| T14 | `tests/test_induce_skill.py` | no absolute path, run directory or downstream name in `src/gnd/skills/gnd-induce/`, using the same patterns as `test_ik6_walk.py` T3 (imported, not copied); `test_ik6_walk.py` is not edited | pass; a seeded absolute path fails |
| T15 | `tests/test_schema_sync.py` (D3) | the vendored `labels.schema.json` is byte-identical to `src/gnd/labels.schema.json` | pass; a one-byte edit fails |
| T16 | `tests/test_public_built_inventory.py` (`-m distribution`) | wheel and sdist carry exactly the pinned set | pass |

Honest limit: T8 checks sentences, and a sentence test cannot fail when an
agent ignores the sentence. IS1 does not claim that an agent behaves as the
skill says. IS2's recordings are that evidence (plan D10).

**Proposed gate** (fixed at the gate):

```text
uv run pytest -q -p no:randomly tests/test_packaged_skills.py tests/test_verification_fixes.py tests/test_install.py tests/test_doctor_uninstall.py tests/test_marketplace_plugins.py tests/test_public_agents_skill_table.py tests/test_public_packaged_invocation_guards.py tests/test_public_packaged_import_skill_routes.py tests/test_skill_prose_sync.py tests/test_solve_successors.py tests/test_ik6_skill_census.py tests/test_ik_close.py tests/test_ik6_walk.py tests/test_schema_sync.py tests/test_public_distribution_runtime.py tests/test_induce_skill.py
uv run pytest -q -p no:randomly -m distribution tests/test_public_built_inventory.py
```

## 9. Out of scope for IS1

- the tutorial, commands page, recordings and release notes (IS2);
- any change to the four commands, their exits or schemas;
- a learner runner command, installing Popper, or a real Popper run;
- a new `gnd-solve` station;
- edits to a `FROZEN_SKILLS` member or to the IK milestone's records.

## 10. Size

Estimate: about 180 lines of skill prose, 5 route sentences, about 120 lines of
new test (`test_induce_skill.py`), and about 40 lines of pin edits across 8 test
files. No `src/gnd` module changes.

## 11. Approval instrument

Spec prose plus checkpoint **C0** (plan D15). C0 is a mockup of the rewritten
tutorial: each step's `/gnd:gnd-induce` prompt beside the result the commands
page already prints. It is labelled a mockup, published as a private page for
the owner, and shown before the skill text is final. C0 binds the prompts the
skill must serve. It is not a recording, and the tutorial does not use it.
